# Testing Rules for Invotek

## Testing Overview

Invotek follows comprehensive testing strategies including unit tests, widget tests, and integration tests with proper mocking and test coverage.

## Testing Structure

```
test/
├── unit/ (Unit tests)
├── widget/ (Widget tests)
├── integration/ (Integration tests)
└── helpers/ (Test helpers and mocks)
```

## Testing Types

### Unit Tests

- Test business logic in Cubits
- Test repository methods
- Test data models
- Test utility functions
- Test validation logic

### Widget Tests

- Test UI components
- Test user interactions
- Test state changes
- Test error states
- Test loading states

### Integration Tests

- Test complete user flows
- Test API integration
- Test navigation
- Test data persistence
- Test error scenarios

