## Common Test Patterns

### Async Testing Pattern

```dart
test('should handle async operation', () async {
  // Arrange
  when(mockRepo.getData()).thenAnswer((_) async => testData);

  // Act
  await cubit.loadData();

  // Assert
  expect(cubit.state, isA<SuccessState>());
});
```

### Stream Testing Pattern

```dart
test('should emit states in correct order', () async {
  // Arrange
  when(mockRepo.getData()).thenAnswer((_) async => testData);

  // Act & Assert
  expectLater(
    cubit.stream,
    emitsInOrder([
      isA<LoadingState>(),
      isA<SuccessState>(),
    ]),
  );

  await cubit.loadData();
});
```

### Exception Testing Pattern

```dart
test('should handle exceptions', () async {
  // Arrange
  when(mockRepo.getData()).thenThrow(Exception('Test error'));

  // Act & Assert
  expect(
    () => cubit.loadData(),
    throwsA(isA<Exception>()),
  );
});
```

